{"resourceIdentifier":"1285","resourceName":"New Leaf Carbon Project","description":"The Tasmanian Land Conservancy (TLC) is an environmental NGO that uses business principles to achieve conservation outcomes. Our vision is for Tasmania to be a global leader in nature conservation and sustainability.   In June 2010 the TLC purchased 28,000 hectares of temperate forests, wetlands and marshes from a logging company and has subsequently implemented the New Leaf Carbon Project over the logged forest.  The project is jointly validated under the VCS/CCBA protocols to the gold standard.  It protects the Red Listed Tasmanian Devil, a huge array of curious marsupials, and amongst many other species, the magnificent Wedge-tailed eagle.   Contiguous with the Tasmanian Wilderness World Heritage Area, it contains entire watersheds of pristine ecosystems and animal habitat.  Areas not covered by the Project are managed purely for conservation under legal protection.  Continuous monitoring of the animals, plants and carbon are reported every five (5) years.   This is a special place.","location":{"latitude":-42.713391,"longitude":147.688328},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1285"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tasmania"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tasmanian Land Conservancy"},{"type":"string","value":"MAHARASHTRA, India"},{"type":"string","value":"+912240012674"},{"type":"string","value":"pradeep.gupta@powericaltd.com"},{"type":"string","value":"www.powericaltd.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1285"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1285"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"43106"}]},{"code":"TOT